{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28679","headline":"旅宿 · 杜牧","name":"旅宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旅馆无良伴，凝情自悄然。\n寒灯思旧事，断鴈警愁眠。\n远梦归侵晓，家书到隔年。\n湘江好烟月，门系钓鱼船。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28679.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28679","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“旅宿”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"据萧涤非《唐诗鉴赏辞典》“旅宿”条（上海辞书出版社，1983 年版）"}